  "title": "cesium 使用PinBuilder 自定义广告牌内容",
  "description": "如果没有形状要求，可以使用cesium官方的广告牌，只需要修改内容跟颜色就可以了。cesium提供的广告牌。",
  "content": "<p>cesium提供的广告牌<br>\n<img src=\"http://t3wothpyb.hn-bkt.clouddn.com/bfd5abea646f472b9a8cfa166f1b7cf3.png\" alt=\"在这里插入图片描述\"></p>\n<p>如果没有形状要求，可以使用cesium官方的广告牌，只需要修改内容跟颜色就可以了</p>\n<pre><code class=\"prism language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> pinBuilder <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Cesium<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>PinBuilder</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\nviewer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>entities<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">position</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> cartesian<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">billboard</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token literal-property property\">image</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span>  pinBuilder<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">fromText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> color<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">38</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toDataURL</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token literal-property property\">pixelOffset</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Cesium<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Cartesian2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">20</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p><img src=\"http://t3wothpyb.hn-bkt.clouddn.com/fb24b9ed55554a85a852af22ada257df.png\" alt=\"在这里插入图片描述\"></p>\n\n",
  "markdowncontent": "cesium提供的广告牌\n![在这里插入图片描述](http://t3wothpyb.hn-bkt.clouddn.com/bfd5abea646f472b9a8cfa166f1b7cf3.png)\n\n如果没有形状要求，可以使用cesium官方的广告牌，只需要修改内容跟颜色就可以了\n```js\nconst pinBuilder = new Cesium.PinBuilder();\nviewer.entities.add({\n      position: cartesian,\n      billboard: {\n        image:  pinBuilder.fromText(index, color, 38).toDataURL(),\n        pixelOffset: new Cesium.Cartesian2(0, -20)\n      }\n    })\n```\n\n![在这里插入图片描述](http://t3wothpyb.hn-bkt.clouddn.com/fb24b9ed55554a85a852af22ada257df.png)\n\n",
